        "raw": "[quote=\"Rabit\"]\n\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>jffdougan wrote:</b><br />\n<blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">If'n you can find it secondhand, what about Crossbows &amp; Catapults?\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n\nI still have two of their sets (don't remember the names) in the garage. It's a fun little game! ![](upload://nchIGjrCD2ydeKFOxqHOVH9DOiO.gif)The trebuchet is sitting on my desk at the office. Turns out it works great for hurling Skittles (and similar candies) to waiting teammates. ![](upload://lNCUQFYSA7ZMqVCMtPuFwzz40RT.gif)Shame I no longer work with teammates who enjoy that kind of fun. ![](upload://cMxHQaDq0kbGxwGJQa30HupNF6d.gif)\n\n[/quote]\n\nAre you hiring? A Skittles catapult is a pretty awesome incentive!",
